wildos-cooler (0.1.8) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The liquid temperature reads correctly while faces show on the cooler,
    instead of 0.
  * Each picture is shown only once the cooler confirms it is stored, and
    the cooler's picture memory is emptied whenever faces stop, so a restart
    no longer leaves a frozen picture and a cooler nothing can find until
    the power is cut.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:30:00 +0000

